<p>Video tanpa jeda\\/editing diperlukan untuk klaim kerusakan, kekurangan, atau ketidaksesuaian. Tanpa video unboxing, retur\\/komplain tidak dapat diproses.<\\/p>\",\"regular_price\":\"250000.00\",\"sale_price\":\"129998.00\",\"weight\":\"250\",\"length\":\"15\",\"width\":\"5\",\"height\":\"5\",\"status\":\"draft\",\"is_featured\":\"0\",\"is_new_arrival\":\"0\",\"is_best_seller\":\"0\",\"images\":[{\"id\":\"155\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/axegearofficial.com\\/storage\\/product\\/axegear-x-rkynd-parfum-zissel-bold-amber-unisex-50ml-amber-woody-tahan-lama-eau-de-parfum-cocok-trail-trabasan\\/axegear-x-rkynd-parfum-zissel-bold-amber-unisex-50ml-amber-woody-tahan-lama-eau-de-parfum-cocok-trail-trabasan-1-1d76b966-8bbd-4cfa-9af8-4bfd219537de.webp\",\"alt_text\":\"AXEGEAR X RKYND Parfum Zissel Bold Amber Unisex 50ml | Amber Woody Tahan Lama | Eau De Parfum | Cocok Trail & Trabasan\",\"sort_order\":\"0\",\"is_primary\":\"1\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":\"156\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/axegearofficial.com\\/storage\\/product\\/axegear-x-rkynd-parfum-zissel-bold-amber-unisex-50ml-amber-woody-tahan-lama-eau-de-parfum-cocok-trail-trabasan\\/axegear-x-rkynd-parfum-zissel-bold-amber-unisex-50ml-amber-woody-tahan-lama-eau-de-parfum-cocok-trail-trabasan-2-2cc3812a-a51e-4be1-b9c9-42492004c8da.webp\",\"alt_text\":\"AXEGEAR X RKYND Parfum Zissel Bold Amber Unisex 50ml | Amber Woody Tahan Lama | Eau De Parfum | Cocok Trail & Trabasan\",\"sort_order\":\"0\",\"is_primary\":\"0\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":\"157\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/axegearofficial.com\\/storage\\/product\\/axegear-x-rkynd-parfum-zissel-bold-amber-unisex-50ml-amber-woody-tahan-lama-eau-de-parfum-cocok-trail-trabasan\\/axegear-x-rkynd-parfum-zissel-bold-amber-unisex-50ml-amber-woody-tahan-lama-eau-de-parfum-cocok-trail-trabasan-3-28a365ee-0185-4db2-8178-890f4683c7c2.webp\",\"alt_text\":\"AXEGEAR X RKYND Parfum Zissel Bold Amber Unisex 50ml | Amber Woody Tahan Lama | Eau De Parfum | Cocok Trail & Trabasan\",\"sor