(12, 'Finding Your Ideal Trail Setup', 'finding-your-ideal-trail-setup', 'Lifestyle', 'AxeGear Editorial', 'Finding Your Ideal Trail Setup offers practical guidance for more confident riding.', 'Good preparation keeps the setup simple, useful, and easy to trust in real conditions.', '[{\"heading\":\"Understand the Conditions\",\"paragraphs\":[\"Start by observing terrain, light, weather, ride duration, and the equipment already in use.\"]},{\"heading\":\"Build a Repeatable Setup\",\"paragraphs\":[\"Change one variable at a time and keep choices that improve comfort or control.\"]}]', 'Performance improves when preparation becomes clear, repeatable, and honest.', '[\"Prepare equipment before the session begins.\",\"Test changes in the conditions where they will be used.\"]', 'Keep the process practical and let real riding experience guide the next adjustment.', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544191696-102dbdaeeaa0?auto=format&fit=crop&q=88&w=1400', 4, '2026-06-02', 1, '2026-08-17 07:10:27', '2026-08-17 07:10:27');

